TEXT:

#if(v_b3_ch8_king != 5) {
 "Alright," Daren says, checking the fastenings on his heavy breastplate. "Is everyone ready?"

"For better or for worse... we are ready," Kate says, her cloak fastened tight and her staff in hand.

"Then let us head to the waiting room," Daren says. "The underground king will have his vanguard assembled for the deployment."

"Do you think we chose the right side?" Hadrik asks quietly, adjusting his backpack. "In the grander scheme, I mean."

"We will only know for certain once the dust settles above," Daren replies. "Until then, we stand by our choice."

"Aye," Hadrik says with a firm nod. "Let us move."

}
#if(v_b3_ch8_king == 5) {
 "Alright," Daren says, checking the fastenings on his heavy breastplate. "Is everyone ready?"

"For better or for worse... we are ready," Kate says, her cloak fastened tight and her staff in hand.

"Then let us head to the waiting room," Daren says. "The underground king will have his vanguard assembled for the deployment."

"Do you think we chose the right side?" Hadrik asks quietly, adjusting his backpack. "In the grander scheme, I mean."

"We will only know for certain once the dust settles above," Daren replies. "But whatever happens on the surface, I believe we gave the people of Ollendor the finest candidate they could have hoped for."

"Aye," Hadrik says with a firm nod. "Let us move."

