 We shoulder our packs and make our way toward the waiting hall, Daren's words settling in the quiet of our minds. There is no certainty in war until the final blow lands. Even with every contingency weighed and every vow spoken, unforeseen variables remain. Yet one truth stands clear as we march into the assembly:

No matter what unfolds above, today's battle will decide the fate of Ollendor once and for all.

